sequenceDiagram
    %% Creator Complete Journey from Login to Business Outcome

    autonumber
    actor Creator as Creator
    participant Auth as Auth & Onboarding (/onboarding)
    participant Dash as Creator Dashboard (/dashboard/creator)
    participant AI as AI Engine (OpenRouter)
    participant Mkt as Project Marketplace (/marketplace/projects)
    actor Buyer as Entrepreneur (Acquirer)
    participant Deals as DealsController (/api/deals)
    participant Mongo as MongoDB Atlas

    %% Login & Onboarding
    Creator->>Auth: Log in with credentials
    Auth->>Auth: Verify Phase 1 KYC Certification
    Auth-->>Dash: Redirect to /dashboard/creator

    %% Idea Refinement
    Dash->>AI: Trigger Idea Clarifier AI
    AI-->>Dash: Return clarity score & market dimensions
    Dash->>AI: Generate Institutional Business Plan & 5-Year Forecast
    AI-->>Dash: Persist in CreatorIdeas.OutputSnapshots

    %% Pricing & Crossroads
    Dash->>Dash: Calculate Recommended Buyout Price (€75,000)
    Dash->>Dash: Select Crossroads: Path A (Full Buyout)

    %% Marketplace & Acquisition
    Dash->>Mkt: Publish Project Listing
    Buyer->>Mkt: Discover Project & Initiate Buyout
    Buyer->>Deals: POST /api/deals/buyout/initiate
    Deals->>Dash: Real-time notification: "New Buyout Offer"

    %% Negotiation & Signatures
    Creator->>Deals: Review & Accept Buyout Terms
    Creator->>Deals: Sign Buyout Agreement (Digital Signature)
    Buyer->>Deals: Sign Buyout Agreement (Digital Signature)

    %% Escrow & Handover Outcome
    Buyer->>Deals: Fund Escrow
    Creator->>Deals: Confirm Payment & Upload IP Handover Package
    Deals->>Mongo: Mark Deal Completed & CreatorIdea as SOLD
    Buyer->>Deals: POST /api/deals/{id}/build-company
    Deals-->>Creator: Business Outcome: 100% Cash Realization & Clean IP Exit
